  "version": "0.10.4",
  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-007 and 009 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah and Yone. Version 0.10.4 targets Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.1 and keeps Yone's active contract Q/W/R. It fixes the post-draft crash from saved seasons that embed retired Yone E and Shen native-effect names by resolving exactly those seven saved references through a no-op compatibility effect; active champion data, resources and the release manifest still contain no Yone E implementation. W Spirit Cleave keeps one bounded, deduplicated target ledger and settles one shield, while avoiding opaque ModService calls across the base 0.5.0 SDK to 0.5.1 host boundary. Legacy base-0.5.0 client/server extensions and four Ban/Pick layout overrides are disabled by default. Official audio, the native actor contract and the readable 54-frame battle face remain intact.",
  "last_updated": "2026-07-17",
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "mod_id": "base",
      "version": ">=0.5.1"
    }
  ]
}
